flowchart TD
    %% Container Architecture Diagram (C4 Level 2) for FSD-SDG-4

    subgraph ClientContainer [Client Container: Browser / Mobile Web]
        SPA[Single Page Application<br>React 18+, TypeScript, Vite, Tailwind CSS<br>TanStack Query, React Router, Headless UI]
    end

    subgraph BackendContainer [Backend Application Container: Node.js LTS]
        API[Express Application Server<br>RESTful API Gateway /api/v1<br>Strict Zod Validation, Pino Logging, Helmet]
        
        subgraph InternalModules [Domain Modules]
            M_ID[Identity & Sessions]
            M_SCH[Schools & Setup]
            M_USR[Users & Rosters]
            M_ATT[Attendance Engine]
            M_CWK[Coursework & Grading]
            M_SUP[Support Intervention]
            M_AUD[Audit Logging]
        end

        ORM[Prisma Client Data Access Layer<br>Multi-Tenant Extension & Connection Pool]
    end

    subgraph StorageContainers [Persistent Data Containers]
        DB[(PostgreSQL 16+ Database<br>Shared Relational Schema<br>B-Tree Composite Indexes & Constraints)]
        BLOB[(Cloud Object Storage<br>S3-Compatible Blob Store)]
    end

    SPA -->|HTTPS / JSON REST API<br>HttpOnly Session Cookies| API
    API --> InternalModules
    InternalModules --> ORM
    ORM -->|Parameterized SQL over TLS| DB
    API -->|Pre-signed Upload / Download URLs| BLOB
